| depth_neighbour | 3 | -0.000418 | 0.001988 | 0.4 |
| width_neighbour | 3 | +0.012623 | 0.001988 | 11.0 |

## Recommended fence radius

**0.05** -- the smallest tested radius whose real signal is at least 3x A-within.


